rd.","prompt":"We ___ in a small guest house near the beach.","options":["toured","boring","stayed"],"answer":"stayed"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct word.","prompt":"The weather was ___ — rain every single day.","options":["awful","interesting","boring"],"answer":"awful"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"rows","title":"Tom is back from a trip. A friend asks him about it.","sub":"","track":"A1_L4_8_7.mp3","items":[{"q":"Where did Tom go?","options":["Mexico","Spain","Guatemala"],"answer":"Guatemala"},{"q":"Why did he go there?","options":["It's a really interesting country.","It was cheap.","His family lives there."],"answer":"It's a really interesting country."},{"q":"What was his favourite thing?","options":["The beach","The food","The Mayan ruins in Tikal"],"answer":"The Mayan ruins in Tikal"},{"q":"Why did you go there? ____","options":["It's a really interesting country.","Lots of tours and trekking.","About six weeks.","No — mostly guest houses.","Yes, I did."],"answer":"It's a really interesting country."},{"q":"What did you do? ____","options":["It's a really interesting country.","Lots of tours and trekking.","About six weeks.","No — mostly guest houses.","Yes, I did."],"answer":"Lots of tours and trekking."}]},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Interview your teacher about their last trip.","sub":"Напиши ответ, затем проверь себя","placeholder":"Твой ответ…","model":"I went to…"}]}